# Keluarga stranger library (source-of-truth §5.3)
#
# Bundled, curated licensed-stock or synthetic faces used as Keluarga distractors.
# NEVER real private individuals photographed without consent.
#
# MVP target: 10–15 images, demographically diverse enough to plausibly resemble
# Indonesian families, candid phone-photo-realistic style.
#
# Naming convention (load-bearing — BundledStrangerLibrary parses this):
#   stranger_<agegroup>_<nn>.<ext>   e.g. stranger_adult_03.jpg
# <agegroup> is one of: child, teen, adult, elderly (core/constants/domain_enums.dart
# AgeGroup). It is load-bearing: Keluarga's similarity dial is demographic
# closeness of the stranger (§4.4), so the loader must be able to filter by it.
#
# TODO(IT-2): the files currently in this folder are placeholders generated by
# tool/generate_stranger_placeholders.dart (solid colour + burned-in label,
# clearly not real photos). Replace them with the curated 10-15 image set
# before demo — no code change needed, the loader reads whatever is here.
